category: Libs
requires: libdaq3 pkg-config
sdesc: "Data AcQuisition Library (development)"
ldesc: "LibDAQ is a pluggable abstraction layer for interacting with a data source
(traditionally a network interface or network data plane). Applications using
LibDAQ use the library API defined in daq.h to load, configure, and interact
with pluggable DAQ modules."
external-source: libdaq

